---
title: Feedback and rating projection
---
sequenceDiagram
	actor Customer
	participant Rating as Rating API
	participant RatingDB as Rating database
	participant Events as Integration messaging
	participant Catalog as Catalog API
	participant CatalogDB as Catalog database

	Customer ->> Rating: Submit feedback for a book
	Rating ->> Rating: Validate rating and feedback
	Rating ->> RatingDB: Persist feedback
	Rating ->> Events: Publish FeedbackCreatedIntegrationEvent
	Events ->> Catalog: Deliver feedback-created event

	alt Book exists
		Catalog ->> CatalogDB: Update book rating summary
		CatalogDB -->> Catalog: Projection updated
		Note over RatingDB,CatalogDB: Reviews owns feedback, Catalog owns the derived summary
	else Book reference is invalid
		Catalog ->> Events: Publish BookUpdatedRatingFailedIntegrationEvent
		Events ->> Rating: Deliver projection-failure event
		Rating ->> RatingDB: Delete invalid feedback record
		Note over Rating,Catalog: Compensation preserves the ownership boundary
	end
